# Public keys that may sign AegisTARA update manifests: `key-id public-key`,
# same format as vendor.keys. Kept separate from the license keys, so a leaked
# license key cannot ship code to customers' computers.
#
# This build carries no key yet, so the client trusts no update. Before the
# first release, the owner adds the production update key here
# (docs/release-checklist.md).
